r of immersive technologies to revolutionize the way we simulate, analyze, and solve real-world challenges.\n\nKey Features\nRealistic Simulations: Experience highly detailed and interactive simulations tailored to your business needs.\nInnovative Solutions Testing: Experiment with new ideas and strategies in a controlled virtual environment.\nCollaboration Tools: Seamlessly collaborate with your team to bring ideas to life.\nCustomizable Scenarios: Adjust and optimize scenarios to fit your unique requirements.\nUse Cases\nTrain and educate your workforce using realistic, hands-on simulations.\nPrototype and test innovative solutions before real-world implementation.\nConduct in-depth analysis and gain actionable insights for decision-making.\nAt RMG, we\u2019re dedicated to driving innovation forward. The RMG Simulation App is your platform to explore, innovate, and achieve!", "short_description": "A cutting-edge simulation app designed for RMG Innovation Lab to explore and test future-ready solutions. Unlock new possibilities with immersive experiences!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/6009e897-7b9f-49a2-9870-2d8074fb047b", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RMG Innovation Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.rmg-sa.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["S